{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the heads of the fathers' houses of the families of the children of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Menasseh, drew near.</b> This parashah too is joined with the passage where Moses was commanded to give cities to the Levites from the inheritance of Israel. And 'the heads of the fathers' houses' are the princes."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:59.320754398Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}